01:46:15 FORM {"title":"Wand controls","content":"Classic: Right click (Bedrock: press and hold, or LT) picks the next spell. Sneak + right click opens your spell list. Q goes back one spell. Left click casts.\n\nSneak bars: Right click (press and hold, or LT) opens your spell bar. Tap a spell on the bar to cast it. Sneak once to flip to the next bar (1, 2, 3, then back to 1). Right click again to close it.\n\nYou can switch back any time.","buttons":[{"text":"Classic (now)"},{"text":"Sneak bars"}],"type":"fo
